1. Project Title
Auto Ticket Classification using Flow Designer
2. System Design
The system is designed to automatically classify school IT helpdesk tickets using ServiceNow Flow Designer.
When a new ticket is created, the system checks the ticket information and identifies the issue based on keywords. It then automatically assigns the appropriate Category and Subcategory.
3. Main Components
The project consists of the following components:
Incident WorkFlow Table
Caller Field
Category Field
Subcategory Field
Short Description Field
Description Field
State Field
Assigned Group Field
Assigned To Field
Flow Designer Automation
Email Notification
