The Subcategory field is designed as a dependent field based on the selected Category.
5. Flow Design
The Flow Designer is designed with the following process:
Record Created → Check Short Description → Identify Issue → Assign Category → Assign Subcategory → Send Email Notification
6. Classification Logic
Wi-Fi / Network → Network → Wi-Fi
Projector / Hardware → Hardware → Projector
Password / Login / Forgot Password → Access → Forgot Password
Slow / Hanging / Slow Computer → Performance → Slow Computer
7. Notification Design
After the ticket is classified, an automated email is sent to the Caller confirming that the request has been submitted.
8. Expected Design Outcome
The project design provides a structured workflow for automatically classifying school IT helpdesk tickets. It reduces manual classification and provides standardized ticket information and automated notifications.
